<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.34 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 6.34 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 6.34 percent in the week ending September 28 from 6.52 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES     Sept 28    Sept 21    Sept 30, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change   +6.34	+6.52	  +8.76</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82) 316.9	317.0	  298.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended September 30, 1995.</p>
</text>
